メラっち寝過ごしたけどめっちゃ頑張ってとっても偉くて可愛い！ Good job cute Melacchi, Thank you! Yes, I'm...
"Melacchi overspent time sleeping but worked super hard, so admirable and cute!" Good job cute Melacchi, thank you! Yes, I'm...

852
01:09:18,211 --> 01:09:24,711
Good job cute Melacchi のじゃ！ のじゃー！
...good job cute Melacchi noja! Noja!

853
01:09:25,211 --> 01:09:29,211
ぬけてた。ぬけてた
I skipped it. I skipped it.

854
01:09:29,711 --> 01:09:37,211
Yes, Next Noja English Travel... Travel Noja! 次は前日しっかり寝よう
Yes, Next Noja English, Travel... Travel Noja! Next time, I'll sleep well the night before.

855
01:09:37,211 --> 01:09:47,711
いや、なんかね、できるだけ「のじゃイングリッシュ」の前日は、その、自分の枠の配信入れないようにしてて、しっかり寝たいから
Yeah, like, as much as possible before Noja English, I try not to schedule my own solo stream so I can get a good sleep.

856
01:09:48,011 --> 01:10:02,211
でもね、あの、やっぱコラボとかだとね、相手の都合とかさ、自分だけのスケジュールで決められないからね。コラボがある日は、ちょっと次の日の「のじゃイングリッシュ」は危険かもね。そこしか空いてない場合とかもあるからね。しょうがないのじゃ
But, you know, with collabs, there's the other person's schedule and all, so I can't decide it all on my own. On days with collabs, the next day's Noja English might be a bit risky. Sometimes that's the only available slot, so it can't be helped.

857
01:10:04,219 --> 01:10:08,169
も... ありがとう。めらちゃんの笑顔元気になれるから大好きです。送ってくれてありがとうなのじゃ。
Mo... thank you. "I love Mela-chan's smile because it energizes me. Thank you for sending it, noja."

858
01:10:08,269 --> 01:10:12,919
あい... スリープ... 昼寝する、ナップ。
I... sleep... Taking a nap, nap.

859
01:10:13,019 --> 01:10:18,019
Good morning なのじゃ。Mela's English is doing great today, やった！
Good morning, noja. "Mela's English is doing great today," yay!

860
01:10:18,219 --> 01:10:21,719
Yes, take a good rest なのじゃ〜。
Yes, take a good rest, noja~

861
01:10:23,019 --> 01:10:27,919
Yes, have a good rest, good rest なのじゃ〜。Good rest するよ〜。
Yes, have a good rest, good rest, noja~ I'll get a good rest~

862
01:10:30,719 --> 01:10:33,719
Amazing that you're working hard, yes!

863
01:10:34,019 --> 01:10:37,919
そう、昨日のね、コラボあったのに頑張ったのじゃ。
Yeah, even though I had a collab yesterday, I worked hard, noja.

864
01:10:38,419 --> 01:10:40,219
うん、うん、うん...
Mm, mm, mm...

865
01:10:40,319 --> 01:10:45,419
I discovered Hololive this year and it brought me a lot of joy and all that, いいね！
"I discovered Hololive this year and it brought me a lot of joy and all that." That's nice!

866
01:10:45,519 --> 01:10:47,919
いい、いい、いい。
Good, good, good.

867
01:10:48,019 --> 01:10:57,819
You are one of my oshis, and I was wondering if it was okay to get a birthday wish from you and the Meragumi, noja.

868
01:10:57,919 --> 01:11:04,019
お誕生日なの、主？お誕生日おめでとうなんじゃ！おめでとう！
Is it your birthday, Master? Happy birthday, noja! Congratulations!

869
01:11:08,319 --> 01:11:12,319
I'm... I'm reading you guys' comments now.

870
01:11:13,319 --> 01:11:18,219
えーっと... 読めました。読めました〜！
Umm... I was able to read it. I was able to read it~!

871
01:11:21,019 --> 01:11:24,319
"This time, please have sweet dream." Yes!

872
01:11:24,519 --> 01:11:30,719
そうだ！スウィートドリームが見たいの！スウィートドリーム！あの、怖い夢見たからな。ナイトメア見たからな。
That's right! I want to have sweet dreams! Sweet dreams! Because I had a scary dream earlier. I had a nightmare, you see.

873
01:11:30,819 --> 01:11:35,119
ちょっともう... わし、わしもダメ... わしもふにゃふにゃな変な夢見たから。
Gosh... I can't... I also had a weird, squishy, strange dream.

874
01:11:35,219 --> 01:11:41,019
この後ゆっくり休むのじゃ。ありがとうなのじゃ。Thank you なのじゃ〜。
I'll take a good rest after this, noja. Thank you, noja. Thank you, noja~

875
01:11:42,419 --> 01:11:45,219
レッスン料あった。ありがとうなのじゃ〜。
There was a lesson fee. Thank you, noja~

876
01:11:45,319 --> 01:11:52,019
でもし、どちらかというと主らに払わなきゃかもね。だって主ら英語教えてくれるもんね、コメント欄でね。
But honestly, if anything, I might need to pay you guys. Because you guys teach me English in the comments.

877
01:11:52,219 --> 01:11:55,719
一人じゃできないしな。一人じゃできないのじゃ。
I can't do it alone. I can't do it alone, noja.

878
01:11:56,419 --> 01:12:00,219
"Congratulations on your progress in English."

879
01:12:00,319 --> 01:12:04,019
"Super smart and cute salamander," なのじゃ。
"Super smart and cute salamander," noja.

880
01:12:04,119 --> 01:12:08,419
Yes, I'm smart and cute salamander, なのじゃ〜。
Yes, I'm a smart and cute salamander, noja~

881
01:12:09,319 --> 01:12:12,719
今日もお仕事頑張ってきます。お仕事頑張ってのじゃ！
"I'll work hard at my job today too." Work hard at your job, noja!

882
01:12:12,819 --> 01:12:18,819
そうだよね、主ら学校とかお仕事の時間始まるんじゃないの？もしや始まっているんじゃないの？
Right, aren't your school or work hours starting soon? Or maybe they've already started?

883
01:12:18,919 --> 01:12:21,819
主らお仕事頑張ってね〜。
Do your best at work, everyone~

884
01:12:22,719 --> 01:12:28,619
ねむねむボイスが聴けて幸せなのじゃ。お仕事頑張ってくるね。お仕事頑張ってね、主ら〜！
"I'm happy to hear your sleepy voice, noja. I'll go work hard." Work hard at work, everyone~!

885
01:12:29,019 --> 01:12:32,219
わしは... ごめんね、お昼寝するね。
As for me... sorry, I'm going to take a nap.

886
01:12:33,119 --> 01:12:36,119
わしはお昼寝するね〜。
I'm going to take a nap~

887
01:12:41,019 --> 01:12:45,019
主ら... お休み。お休み〜。
Everyone... good night. Good night~

888
01:12:45,219 --> 01:12:53,719
ゆっくり寝てね。ありがとうなのじゃ〜。ゆっくり寝るのじゃ〜。
Sleep well. Thank you, noja~ Sleep well, noja~

889
01:12:55,519 --> 01:12:58,819
じゃあね。今日は頑張りました。
See ya. I worked hard today.

890
01:12:58,919 --> 01:13:04,819
クッキーを食べて寝ます。いろは先輩にもらったクッキーを食べて寝ようと思います。
I'll eat cookies and go to sleep. I'll eat the cookies I got from Iroha-senpai and go to sleep.

891
01:13:05,019 --> 01:13:08,419
今日の夜... あ、サムネ入っとるか。
Tonight... Ah, is the thumbnail set?

892
01:13:12,419 --> 01:13:14,219
ライトに... むじゃ！
Lightly... muja!

893
01:13:14,719 --> 01:13:21,019
今日の夜9時からは、キョーコとコラボ〜！
Tonight from 9 PM, a collab with Kyoko~!

894
01:13:21,519 --> 01:13:29,719
キョーコがね、お家に来てくれてね、お酒飲んでね、オフコラボするんだ〜。
Kyoko is coming over to my place, and we're going to drink and do an off-collab~

895
01:13:30,219 --> 01:13:37,619
んじゃけ、だから、あの、今日、お部屋をさ、片付けようと思ったんだけど... ちょっと寝るわ、キョーコ、ごめん。
So, like, I was thinking of cleaning up my room today... but I'm gonna sleep a bit, Kyoko, sorry.

896
01:13:40,019 --> 01:13:43,719
ちょっと寝るわ、キョーコ。お昼寝ダイノジ〜。
I'm gonna sleep a bit, Kyoko. Sprawled out for a nap~

897
01:13:44,219 --> 01:13:47,219
お昼寝するだけでいいの？
Is it really okay if I just take a nap?

898
01:13:48,219 --> 01:13:52,219
お休みなのじゃ。お仕事頑張ってのじゃ〜。
Good night, noja. Work hard at your jobs, noja~

899
01:13:53,419 --> 01:13:56,219
お休みなのじゃ〜。
Good night, noja~

900
01:13:58,219 --> 01:14:05,419
それでは... 主ら... さらばじゃ〜！
Well then... everyone... farewell, noja~!

901
01:14:08,819 --> 01:14:13,719
[Text: ご視聴感謝なのじゃ！]
[Text: Thank you for watching, noja!]

